{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0a9429f3-672c-8dbb-a4f3-93198d748e4a",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T12:12:15-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Tavares",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:10:14-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:10:18-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. Um, I'm calling about a dog. There's a dog tied up outside, and it's, hmm, it's cold out today. Wicked cold with the wind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:10:27-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Where is the dog? Whose property is it on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:10:31-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me see. It's at 16 Bellevue Avenue. Well, I think that's the number. The gate with the stone posts. Yeah, sixteen. I'm across the street at my shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:10:41-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 16 Bellevue Avenue. How long has the dog been out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:10:46-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since this morning, I think. Maybe earlier. It's on a short rope by the steps, no coat, no shelter that I can see. [pause] It keeps shivering and barking, and then it stops, and that's what worries me more."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:10:59-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Does it have water or a bowl near it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:11:03-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, I don't see one. Maybe it's around the side. I don't want to go over there, I don't know the people. Who actually responds to this? Is it the police, or an animal officer, or what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:11:16-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It goes to our animal control officer. I'll take the details and pass them along right now. If the dog looks like it's in real distress, you can also call the police non-emergency line and they'll send someone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:11:29-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. Hmm, do I need to give a name? Or is this, you know, anonymous? Actually, no, never mind, I'll give it. Jorge Tavares."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:11:38-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Tavares. Is there a number where the officer can reach you if they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:11:45-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0176. Oh, and, um, if there's some fee or something for reporting, I just found forty dollars in an old coat pocket this morning, so I can, hmm, I can cover it. If that's how it works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:11:58-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, there's no fee for reporting. Keep your forty dollars. I'm sending this over now, and the officer will follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:12:06-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Thank you. I'll keep an eye on it from the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:12:11-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do. Call back if anything changes. Thanks for calling."
    }
  ],
